From b1d8d83574de5b6dba594c055af9eff82e42b647 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Telaak <joseph@telaak.dev>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:31:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/21] sgx/isa: add sgx-asm and sgx-disasm

sgx-asm assembles a file in one go, writing hex, binary or a listing.
Its user is the build of the GPU's open microkernel firmware, which has
no driver to go through. sgx-disasm disassembles.

Both are built with -Dtools=sgx, as etnaviv-disasm is with
-Dtools=etnaviv. sgx_isa_tools runs the round-trip lists through both.

Assisted-by: LLM
